    <briefdescription>
<para>Computes covariance online using Welford&apos;s algorithm. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This provider collects samples during the calibration phrase (IMU should be stationary) and computes variance using Welford&apos;s numerically stable online algorithm. After calibration_samples are collected, the covariance is frozen and returned for all subsequent queries.</para>
<para>Reference: Welford, B. P. (1962). &quot;Note on method for calculating
corrected sum of squares and products&quot; </para>
    </detaileddescription>
